9151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BoAnkLz0IPsQ7kNvwFuGMwM&_nc_oc=AdmBJ-iFcoaERK6UVpTwo5xMQuOjeoXIcIg7X9kTC7ITRvBQgy7Kb8GIfIU1wLMTTFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsPfepVSE7Dr2C2T49lcAZMhJTdBhFw7dybyzmeq701sg&oe=699AE816"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZsMN5jsA7XQQ7kNvwE_bm4w&_nc_oc=Adm-Qsc6BS20j17JIf1I_SlJy7fvhLUMGZzIkNdqNja7Wu-qQfyi8pWj8X1vKXmZ2fQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv_DdC5Hg-FjjSYy9QIKXgrM0GPi7DyFWHsilLYUzuyJQ&oe=699ADEFD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AfjdgSe6PtIQ7kNvwEBmq0Y&_nc_oc=AdnTEaMnn_DI0bWw3-89n15XtE_hYrP0SabUBn7b7gUTCQoeZ5bJZQ_o3nS9yRlR4Wc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft2Ok9ksXx5-DXGZQABSRTUM4DczDzEzlMlqK0TK1QwDQ&oe=699B0A55"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WR47LUl8c2EQ7kNvwH0LOsA&_nc_oc=AdmKZC8LhbSSx7GJDX7T1jBVuKav__rMExMfLOzoAuZH6DWkStLMGFIw6eqFDtpikSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvkOoGeYDRKOblS4SqP2KBwpOd8HA84XhvZeItQF0NocQ&oe=699AEF27"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR Cover Art.png", "id": "678364797690874", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974640_678364801024207_2897138990588590099_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d3dbnNiR-PIQ7kNvwFVD_42&_nc_oc=Adme2i7SXJ86X7KkuRXOLHbx_it0IK4WUfiWUgAjmpMsPGFP0AhEnzrlBFILIGjp8Ng&_nc_